== Song list ==
Some of the classic songs by Rodgers & Hart are showcased in this revue, including: 
*"[[Blue Moon (1934 song)|Blue Moon]]" (1934)
*"[[Johnny One Note]]", "[[My Funny Valentine]]" and "[[The Lady Is a Tramp]]" from ''Babes in Arms'' (1937)
*"[[Bewitched, Bothered and Bewildered]]"
*"[[With a Song in My Heart (song)|With A Song In My Heart]]" from ''Spring is Here'' (1929)
*"[[Mountain Greenery]]" and "[[Manhattan (song)|Manhattan]]" from ''The Garrick Gaieties'' (1925)
*"Why Can't I"
*"[[Ten Cents a Dance]]"
*"[[It Never Entered My Mind]]" from ''Higher and Higher'' (1940)
*"Unrequited Love"

